---
description: Prefer Epicure MCP for computational flavour questions when the Epicure server is available
alwaysApply: false
---

When the Epicure MCP tools are available and the user asks about ingredient
pairings, substitutions, flavour similarity, cuisine affinity, or flavour-space
transforms, use Epicure tools before inventing culinary structure from general
knowledge alone.

Treat Epicure outputs as learned statistical relationships. Do not present them
as food safety, allergy, medical, or nutritional advice. If a request needs
allergen or dietary compliance guarantees, say Epicure cannot certify that and
recommend human/domain verification.
